The '''Queens of Mischief Cosmetic Pack''' is an active [[Gamepass]] featuring 5 exclusive skins regarding the '''[[Halloween Toons]]''' and {{CI|Connie|name=true}} in [[Dandy's World]]. Additionally, you can get new [[Profile]] customizations, [[Stickers]], and emotes. It was introduced in [[Changelog|v0.29.7]] as the ninth gamepass available in [[Dandy's Store]], [[Dyle's Store]], and [[Gourdy's Store]].

==Description==
This gamepass features 5 exclusive skins for Gourdy, Eclipse, Soulvester, Connie, and Ribecca! Also includes profile cosmetics and 5 unique stickers. These skins feature unique particles, trails and ability effects. All features are cosmetic and do not affect gameplay.

==Effect==
Players who purchased this gamepass are rewarded 600 [[Ichor]] and receive the 5 matching skins for {{CI|Connie|name=true}}, {{CI|Eclipse|name=true}}, {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}, {{CI|Ribecca|name=true}}, and {{CI|Soulvester|name=true}}; They also receive the 5 exclusive QoM-themed [[Stickers]], and [[Profile]] decorations, including a profile frame and background.

