==Trivia==
*This [[Skin]] pack is the first to:
**Not begin with the letter S,
**only have repeated features in the pack (the Toons here were featured in the [[Spooky-Time]] Pack),
**have emotes, [[Profile]] customization, and [[Stickers]],
**not be released at the start of an [[Event]] while being an Event-exclusive Skin pack,
**and to have a price higher that normal Skin packs, also being the first pack with an early bird deal.

